. 
. * Combine: the mean effect, the between-class standard deviation,
. * and a test of whether the classes differ
. nwsaom meta school1 school2 school3 school4

Meta-analysis of 4 fits (RSiena siena08): estimates with a standard error of at least 10 are exclude
> d
Tests of mean parameters use a t distribution with n-1 d.f. (n = number of included groups).

